{"id":"en_stock-queen","title":"Stock Queen","titleEn":"Stock Queen","description":"Riko, ett geni inom trading som utvecklade kärnsystemet NOIR CLAW åt Washida Securities, avskedas orättvist av Washida – den illvillige vd:n som styr företaget med hård hand, med hjälp av en falsk utvecklare. Riko, som känner sig förfördelad, går till Shinsung Securities, ett bolag som köpts av miljonären Kasimiro Ken, och sjösätter en utstuderad hämndplan för att krossa det korrupta Washida Securities. Serien och dess avsnitt kan följas på Dramzio.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/stock-queen/en_US/20cfac1c42282c79/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/stock-queen/en_US/20cfac1c42282c79/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Revenge","Romance","Revenge & Satisfying","Short Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7d4q0m/?pub=4p6i0m","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_stock-queen_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7d4q0m/?pub=4p6i0m","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_stock-queen_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7d4q0m/?pub=4p6i0m","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_stock-queen_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7d4q0m/?pub=4p6i0m","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_stock-queen_4","title":"Episode 4","season":1,"number":4,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7d4q0m/?pub=4p6i0m","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_stock-queen_5","title":"Episode 5","season":1,"number":5,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumbl